  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If you want to copy nodes from old to new, there is an extra bit that needs to be included for new graphs to recognize it: \"application/vnd.unity.graphview.elements \" \nThis can be manually added, so it's not the end of the world but I figured it was worth mentioning. I would assume this was added as some sort of requirement, but if there's any way to remove it then that would allow for just a tiny bit better legacy support.",
